# Gossip: what she knows about other people. {deed} the fact in her words, {who}/{who2} the people, {src} who told
# her, {how} witness/heard/rumor, {exposure} secret/rumored/known, {whobond} how close she is to {who}.

@rule me.gossip
on me.gossip
- [Heard anything interesting lately?|So, what's the latest?|Any news going around?]
- [Tell me something I don't know.|What's everyone talking about?]

@rule me.gossip.close
on me.gossip
when rel=girlfriend|lover|friend
- [Okay, spill.|Come on, I know you know something.]

# ---------------- the facts ----------------
@rule gossip.plain
on gossip
opens ask,agree,tease
- [Did you hear? {Deed}.|Guess what. {Deed}.|So apparently {deed}.] [{When}, too.|Can you believe it?|Nobody saw that coming.]

@rule gossip.couple
on gossip
when realverb=started_dating|engaged
opens ask,agree,tease
feel smile
- [{Who} and {who2} are going out now!|Did you hear? {Who} and {who2}!] [I knew it!|They're so cute together.|I give it a month.]
- [So, {who} and {who2}...|You won't believe who's dating.] [It's official.|{Who} told me herself.]

@rule gossip.breakup
on gossip
when realverb=broke_up
opens ask,defend,agree
feel worried
- [{Who} and {who2} broke up.|It's over between {who} and {who2}.] [{Who} cried all through lunch.|I feel bad for them.|I saw it coming, honestly.]

@rule gossip.fight
on gossip
when realverb=fought|insulted
opens ask,defend,agree
feel worried
- [{Who} and {who2} had a huge fight {when}.|Things are tense between {who} and {who2}.] [Nobody knows why.|Everyone in class went quiet.|I'm staying out of it.]

@rule gossip.madeup
on gossip
when realverb=made_up
opens agree,ask
feel smile
- [{Who} and {who2} made up!|Good news: {who} and {who2} are talking again.] [Finally.|It was getting awkward for everyone.]

@rule gossip.crush
on gossip
when realverb=crush
opens ask,tease,hush
feel smile
- [Don't tell anyone, but... {deed}.|Promise you won't say anything? {Deed}.] [It's so obvious.|She turns red every time.|I'm sworn to secrecy, so you didn't hear it from me.]

@rule gossip.together
on gossip
when realverb=seen_together
opens ask,laugh,defend
- [{Who} and {who2} were seen behind the gym.|Someone saw {who} and {who2} sneaking off together.] [What do you think they were doing?|Scandalous, right?]

@rule gossip.drama
on gossip
when realverb=left_for|cheated
opens ask,defend,agree
feel worried
- [Have you heard the drama? {Deed}.|It's all anyone talks about: {deed}.] [It's a total mess.|I don't know whose side to take.]

@rule gossip.boysroom
on gossip
when realverb=seen_boys_room
opens laugh,defend,hush
feel smile
- [So {who} got caught in the boys' restroom {when}.|Okay, this is embarrassing for her, but... {deed}.] [{laugh}|She says she got lost.|I'd never live it down.]

# ---------------- how she knows ----------------
@rule gossip.heard
on gossip
when how=heard
opens ask,agree,defend
- [{Src} told me {deed}.|According to {src}, {deed}.|I heard from {src} that {deed}.] [Don't say I told you.|{Src} never gets these things wrong.]

@rule gossip.rumor
on gossip
when how=rumor
opens ask,defend,laugh
- [People are saying {deed}.|There's a rumor that {deed}.] [I don't know if it's true.|You know how people talk.|Take it with a grain of salt.]

@rule gossip.saw
on gossip
when how=witness
opens ask,agree,tease
- [I saw it myself: {deed}.|I was right there when {deed}.] [{When}.|Seriously, with my own eyes.]

# ---------------- about a friend of hers ----------------
@rule gossip.friend.worried
on gossip
when whobond>=50 valence<=-1
opens comfort,defend,ask
feel sad
- [I'm worried about {who}.|{Who}'s my friend, so...] [{Deed}.|She's taking it hard.|I don't know how to help her.]

@rule gossip.friend.happy
on gossip
when whobond>=50 valence>=1
opens agree,praise,ask
feel smile
- [I'm so happy for {who}!|{Who} finally did it!] [{Deed}.|She deserves it.]

# ---------------- voices ----------------
@rule gossip.cool
on gossip
when voice=cool|serious|proper
opens ask,agree
- [I don't usually spread rumors, but {deed}.|For what it's worth, {deed}.] [Do what you want with that.|I thought you should know.]

@rule gossip.gyaru
on gossip
when voice=gyaru|open|vamp
opens tease,ask,laugh
feel smile
- [Okay okay okay, so get this: {deed}.|You did NOT hear this from me, but {deed}.] [Like, wow.|I'm dying.|Isn't that wild?]
